---
// KofiSupportBox.astro - Channel patron support card
---

<div class="kofi-support-box my-8 rounded-lg border border-[#27272a] bg-[#18181b] p-6 shadow-md transition-all duration-200">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4">
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#b91c1c]"></span>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-300">
          Support the Archive
        </h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        If this chronicle moved you, consider supporting our independent archival research and translations with a tea.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="shrink-0">
      <a
        href="https://ko-fi.com/redsunjapan"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[#b91c1c] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow transition-colors hover:bg-[#991b1b] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#b91c1c] focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-[#18181b]"
      >
        <span>🍵 Buy the Archive a Tea ($5)</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
